# Keep secrets and bulk out of the build context.
#
# .env is FIRST and matters most: an image is pushed to ECR, and a key baked
# into a layer is not removed by deleting the file in a later layer. .gitignore
# already keeps it out of the repo; this keeps it out of the image.
.env
*.env
!.env.example

.venv/
venv/
.git/
.gitignore
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Not needed at runtime. Tests stay OUT: they pull in nothing the image needs
# and only widen what ships.
tests/
docs/
demo/
eval/
*.md
!README.md
